                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Terrible. Thought it would bring back memories from the game i played as a kid. It has elements but they made levels unlockable only if you get 3 stars in every level in each 'chapter'. This is next to impossible when it takes many turns to fine tune mirror placements to turn light switches on. You'll get to level 20 on your own just fine, but advancement after that will only come from going to a walk through if one even exists and somehow placing and turning each mirror perfectly on the first couple tries. \nDon't waste your money. I thought it would be good for my kids to play but absolutely not.",
